---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
    title="Rreth Nesh"
    pubDate={new Date('January 01 2026')}
>
    <style>
        /* --- MOBILE TWEAKS (Të paprekura) --- */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .editorial-container {
                padding-left: 1rem !important;
                padding-right: 1rem !important;
            }
            .headline-main {
                font-size: 1.5rem !important;
                line-height: 1.3 !important;
            }
            .stats-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
                border-top: 4px double #0f172a;
                border-bottom: 4px double #0f172a;
            }
            .stats-item {
                border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
                padding: 1.5rem 0;
            }
            .stats-item:last-child {
                border-bottom: none;
            }
            .cards-grid {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1.5rem !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
    
    <div class="editorial-container max-w-5xl mx-auto py-8">

        <div class="mb-16 md:px-8 text-center md:text-left">
            <div class="group relative inline-block">
                <p class="headline-main text-xl! md:text-3xl text-slate-700 font-medium leading-relaxed font-['Literata',serif]">
                    <span class="absolute -left-6 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-[#DC2626] transition-all duration-500 group-hover:h-full group-hover:bg-slate-900"></span>
                    Mirë se erdhët në <strong class="text-slate-900 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#DC2626]/20 to-transparent px-2 rounded-md">Lemza News</strong>, platforma numër një në rajon për lajme që nuk kanë ndodhur kurrë, rrëfime të personazheve imagjinarë dhe statistika të shpikura në moment.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stats-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 py-10 my-12 border-y border-slate-200 text-center bg-slate-50/50 rounded-2xl transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl hover:border-slate-300">
            <div class="stats-item group cursor-default transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-110">
                <span class="block text-5xl font-black text-[#DC2626] mb-2 font-['Literata',serif] group-hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">100%</span>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest group-hover:text-[#DC2626]">Gënjeshtra</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stats-item group cursor-default transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-110">
                <span class="block text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-2 font-['Literata',serif]">0</span>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest group-hover:text-slate-900">Fakte</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stats-item group cursor-default transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-110">
                <span class="block text-5xl font-black text-[#DC2626] mb-2 font-['Literata',serif] group-hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">12k</span>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest group-hover:text-[#DC2626]">Padi në Gjykatë</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-20">
            <div class="group bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl hover:border-[#DC2626]/30 relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-20 h-20 bg-slate-50 rounded-bl-full -mr-10 -mt-10 transition-transform group-hover:scale-150 group-hover:bg-[#DC2626]/10"></div>
                
                <h3 class="text-xl! font-black text-slate-900 mb-4 uppercase tracking-tight flex items-center gap-3 font-['Literata',serif]">
                    <span class="w-3 h-3 bg-[#DC2626] rounded-full group-hover:animate-ping"></span> Misioni Ynë
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm font-medium relative z-10">
                    Të raportojmë atë që të tjerët kanë frikë ta imagjinojnë. Ne nuk ndjekim lajmin, ne e krijojmë atë nga hiçi duke përdorur teknologjinë më të fundit të thashethemeve.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="group bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl hover:border-[#DC2626]/30 relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-20 h-20 bg-slate-50 rounded-bl-full -mr-10 -mt-10 transition-transform group-hover:scale-150 group-hover:bg-[#DC2626]/10"></div>

                <h3 class="text-xl! font-black text-slate-900 mb-4 uppercase tracking-tight flex items-center gap-3 font-['Literata',serif]">
                    <span class="w-3 h-3 bg-[#DC2626] rounded-full group-hover:animate-ping"></span> Standardet
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm font-medium relative z-10">
                    Ne ruajmë standardet më të larta të gazetarisë fiktive. Çdo histori verifikohet me kujdes për t'u siguruar që është absolutisht e pavërtetë dhe e pabazuar.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-20">
            <h2 class="text-3xl! font-black text-slate-900 mb-10 uppercase tracking-tighter border-b-4 border-slate-900 pb-4 inline-block font-['Literata',serif]">
                Redaksia
            </h2>
            
            <div class="cards-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="group bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#DC2626]">
                    <div class="text-[10px] font-black text-[#DC2626] uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 bg-red-50 inline-block px-2 py-1 rounded">Kryeredaktor</div>
                    <strong class="block text-xl! font-['Literata',serif] text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-[#DC2626] transition-colors">Padoras Bregu</strong>
                    <div class="h-px w-10 bg-slate-200 my-3 group-hover:w-full group-hover:bg-[#DC2626] transition-all duration-500"></div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                        Nuk vjen kurrë në zyrë sepse ka frikë nga përmbaruesit dhe ish-gratë.
                    </p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="group bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#DC2626]">
                    <div class="text-[10px] font-black text-[#DC2626] uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 bg-red-50 inline-block px-2 py-1 rounded">Analist</div>
                    <strong class="block text-xl font-['Literata',serif] text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-[#DC2626] transition-colors tracking-tight">Gjithologu i Lagjes</strong>
                    <div class="h-px w-10 bg-slate-200 my-3 group-hover:w-full group-hover:bg-[#DC2626] transition-all duration-500"></div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                        Ekspert në gjeopolitikë, ekonomi dhe çështje sociale, sidomos pas gotës së tretë të rakisë.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="group bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#DC2626]">
                    <div class="text-[10px] font-black text-[#DC2626] uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 bg-red-50 inline-block px-2 py-1 rounded">IT & Siguria</div>
                    <strong class="block text-xl font-['Literata',serif] text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-[#DC2626] transition-colors">Nipi i Pronarit</strong>
                    <div class="h-px w-10 bg-slate-200 my-3 group-hover:w-full group-hover:bg-[#DC2626] transition-all duration-500"></div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                        Di të rregullojë Wi-Fi duke fikur dhe ndezur modemin.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-20">
        
        <div class="group relative bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 hover:border-slate-800 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg flex flex-col">
            <span class="absolute -top-3 left-6 bg-slate-800 text-white px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest shadow-sm group-hover:bg-[#DC2626] transition-colors">
                Njoftim Punësimi
            </span>

            <h3 class="text-2xl! font-black text-slate-900 mb-3 uppercase font-['Literata',serif]">Karriera</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-6 font-medium leading-relaxed text-left">
                A keni imagjinatë të shfrenuar? A dini të bëni tituj bombastikë që nuk kanë lidhje me përmbajtjen?
            </p>

            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 mt-auto">
                <strong class="block text-xs uppercase text-slate-500 mb-4 tracking-widest border-b border-slate-200 pb-2">Ne kërkojmë:</strong>
                <ul class="space-y-3">
                    <li class="flex items-start text-sm text-slate-800 font-bold text-left">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#DC2626] mr-2 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        <span>Gazetarë që nuk verifikojnë burimet.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start text-sm text-slate-800 font-bold text-left">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#DC2626] mr-2 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        <span>Fotografë që dinë Photoshop.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start text-sm text-slate-800 font-bold text-left">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#DC2626] mr-2 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        <span>Ekspertë të Clickbait.</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <em class="block text-center text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase mt-4 font-bold tracking-wide">Pagesa bëhet me "Bravo" dhe ekspozim.</em>
        </div>

        <div class="group relative bg-[#FFF1F2] p-8 rounded-xl border border-red-100 hover:border-[#DC2626]/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0">
                <div class="bg-[#DC2626] text-white text-[10px] font-black px-8 py-1 uppercase tracking-widest rotate-45 translate-x-8 translate-y-4 shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    Oferta
                </div>
            </div>

            <h3 class="text-2xl! font-black text-[#991B1B] mb-3 uppercase font-['Literata',serif]">Reklamo</h3>
            <p class="text-[#7F1D1D] text-sm mb-6 font-medium leading-relaxed text-left">
                Doni të reklamoni produktin tuaj te një audiencë që nuk ekziston? Jeni në vendin e duhur!
            </p>

            <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-red-100 shadow-sm mt-auto">
                <strong class="block text-xs uppercase text-red-400 mb-4 tracking-widest border-b border-red-100 pb-2">Paketat tona:</strong>
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-sm group/item">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover/item:text-[#DC2626] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap">Paketa Bazë</span>
                        <span class="h-px bg-slate-200 flex-1 mx-3 border-b border-dotted border-slate-300"></span>
                        <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium text-right text-xs">Baner i padukshëm</span>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-sm group/item">
                        <span class="font-bold text-[#DC2626] whitespace-nowrap">Paketa Premium</span>
                        <span class="h-px bg-red-200 flex-1 mx-3 border-b border-dotted border-red-300"></span>
                        <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium text-right text-xs tracking-tight">Artikull me gabime</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <em class="block text-right text-[10px] text-red-500 uppercase mt-4 font-bold tracking-wide">Pranojmë vetëm kesh.</em>
        </div>
    </div>

        <div class="group bg-slate-900 text-white p-10 md:p-14 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden isolate">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-[#DC2626]/20 to-slate-900 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity duration-1000"></div>
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#DC2626] to-transparent"></div>

            <div class="relative z-10">
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase mb-4 tracking-tight text-white! font-['Literata',serif]">Na Kontaktoni</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 mb-10 max-w-lg mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Nëse keni ankesa, ju lutemi shkruajini në një copë akulli dhe lërini në diell. 
                    Për çdo gjë tjetër, ja ku na gjeni:
                </p>

                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center gap-6">
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/50 p-5 rounded-xl flex-1 border border-slate-700 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-slate-800 hover:border-[#DC2626]/50 transition-all duration-300">
                        <span class="block text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Email</span>
                        <span class="font-bold text-white tracking-wide">info@lemzanews.com</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/50 p-5 rounded-xl flex-1 border border-slate-700 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-slate-800 hover:border-[#DC2626]/50 transition-all duration-300">
                        <span class="block text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Adresa</span>
                        <span class="font-bold text-white tracking-wide">Pallati pa Leje, Kati -1</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/50 p-5 rounded-xl flex-1 border border-slate-700 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-slate-800 hover:border-[#DC2626]/50 transition-all duration-300">
                        <span class="block text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Telefon</span>
                        <span class="font-bold text-white tracking-wide">+355 69 00 00 000</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</Layout>